<input type="radio" name="q9" id="q9-4">
<label for="q9-4">Almost always</label>
</div>
    <p class="note insight">Lack of empathy leaves wounds unattended. Being heard and taken seriously is a baseline of care, not a luxury.</p>
  </div>
<div class="card qcard">
    <p class="note">Question 10 of 18 · Empathy &amp; accountability</p>
    <p class="q">They rarely take real responsibility — blame shifts to you, circumstances, or “jokes,” with little lasting change.</p>
    <div class="choices">
<input type="radio" name="q10" id="q10-0">
<label for="q10-0">Never</label>
<input type="radio" name="q10" id="q10-1">
<label for="q10-1">Rarely</label>
<input type="radio" name="q10" id="q10-2">
<label for="q10-2">Sometimes</label>
<input type="radio" name="q10" id="q10-3">
<label for="q10-3">Often</label>
<input type="radio" name="q10" id="q10-4">
<label for="q10-4">Almost always</label>
</div>
    <p class="note insight">Accountability means owning impact and changing behaviour. Empty apologies without change keep the cycle spinning.</p>
  </div>
<div class="card qcard">
    <p class="note">Question 11 of 18 · How you feel</p>
    <p class="q">You feel anxious, drained, or “not yourself” more often around them than with other people in your life.</p>
    <div class="choices">
<input type="radio" name="q11" id="q11-0">
<label for="q11-0">Never</label>
<input type="radio" name="q11" id="q11-1">
<label for="q11-1">Rarely</label>
<input type="radio" name="q11" id="q11-2">
<label for="q11-2">Sometimes</label>
<input type="radio" name="q11" id="q11-3">
<label for="q11-3">Often</label>
<input type="radio" name="q11" id="q11-4">
<label for="q11-4">Almost always</label>
</div>
    <p class="note insight">Your nervous system notices patterns before your mind fully names them. Persistent dread or depletion is meaningful information.</p>
  </div>
<div class="card qcard">
    <p class="note">Question 12 of 18 · How you feel</p>
    <p class="q">You second-guess your worth, needs, or reality more than you used to — or feel lonely even when you’re together.</p>
