</div>
    <p class="note insight">Emotional loneliness inside a relationship is a deep form of pain. Reconnecting with your own voice is a brave, healthy step.</p>
  </div>
<div class="card qcard">
    <p class="note">Question 13 of 18 · Gaslighting &amp; reality distortion</p>
    <p class="q">They use private information you shared in trust against you later — during fights or to humiliate you.</p>
    <div class="choices">
<input type="radio" name="q13" id="q13-0">
<label for="q13-0">Never</label>
<input type="radio" name="q13" id="q13-1">
