<input type="radio" name="q13" id="q13-2">
<label for="q13-2">Sometimes</label>
<input type="radio" name="q13" id="q13-3">
<label for="q13-3">Often</label>
<input type="radio" name="q13" id="q13-4">
<label for="q13-4">Almost always</label>
</div>
    <p class="note insight">Weaponizing vulnerability breaks safety. Trust thrives when soft spots are protected, not stored as ammunition.</p>
  </div>
<div class="card qcard">
    <p class="note">Question 14 of 18 · Control &amp; isolation</p>
    <p class="q">They make big decisions that affect you without real input — or punish you (silent treatment, threats, guilt) if you disagree.</p>
    <div class="choices">
<input type="radio" name="q14" id="q14-0">
